<div class="mx-auto max-w-5xl space-y-10 p-4 md:p-6">
  <header class="space-y-1">
    <h1 class="text-2xl font-bold text-heading">Design system</h1>
    <p class="text-sm text-body">
      Patrones base de Tailwind + Flowbite para la migración. Probá el toggle de tema en la barra superior:
      todo debe verse bien en claro y en oscuro.
    </p>
  </header>

  <section class="space-y-3">
    <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-heading">Paleta</h2>
    <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-3 sm:grid-cols-4">
      <% [["primary-500", "bg-primary-500"], ["primary-600", "bg-primary-600"], ["gray-800", "bg-gray-800"], ["gray-900", "bg-gray-900"]].each do |label, bg| %>
        <div class="overflow-hidden rounded-lg border border-default">
          <div class="h-14 <%= bg %>"></div>
          <div class="bg-neutral-primary px-3 py-2 text-xs text-body"><%= label %></div>
        </div>
      <% end %>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="space-y-3">
    <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-heading">Botones</h2>
    <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3">
      <button type="button" class="rounded-lg bg-brand px-5 py-2.5 text-sm font-medium text-white transition-colors hover:bg-brand-strong focus:ring-4 focus:ring-brand-soft">
        Primario
      </button>
      <button type="button" class="rounded-lg border border-default bg-neutral-primary px-5 py-2.5 text-sm font-medium text-body transition-colors hover:bg-neutral-tertiary hover:text-heading focus:ring-4 focus:ring-brand-soft">
        Secundario
      </button>
      <button type="button" class="rounded-lg border border-fg-brand px-5 py-2.5 text-sm font-medium text-fg-brand transition-colors hover:bg-brand hover:text-white focus:ring-4 focus:ring-brand-soft">
        Outline
      </button>
      <button type="button" class="rounded-lg bg-red-600 px-5 py-2.5 text-sm font-medium text-white transition-colors hover:bg-red-700 focus:ring-4 focus:ring-red-300 dark:focus:ring-red-900">
        Peligro
      </button>
      <button type="button" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-lg bg-brand px-5 py-2.5 text-sm font-medium text-white transition-colors hover:bg-brand-strong">
        <%= icon(:add) %> Con icono
      </button>
      <button type="button" disabled class="cursor-not-allowed rounded-lg bg-brand px-5 py-2.5 text-sm font-medium text-white opacity-50">
        Deshabilitado
      </button>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="space-y-3">
    <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-heading">Formulario</h2>
    <div class="grid gap-4 rounded-xl border border-default bg-neutral-primary p-5 md:grid-cols-2">
      <div>
        <label for="gallery-text" class="mb-2 block text-sm font-medium text-heading">Texto</label>
        <input type="text" id="gallery-text" placeholder="Escribí algo"
               class="block w-full rounded-lg border border-default bg-neutral-secondary-soft p-2.5 text-sm text-heading placeholder:text-body-subtle focus:border-brand focus:ring-brand">
      </div>

      <div>
        <label for="gallery-select" class="mb-2 block text-sm font-medium text-heading">Select</label>
        <select id="gallery-select"
                class="block w-full rounded-lg border border-default bg-neutral-secondary-soft p-2.5 text-sm text-heading focus:border-brand focus:ring-brand">
          <option>Una opción</option>
          <option>Otra opción</option>
        </select>
      </div>

      <div class="md:col-span-2">
        <label for="gallery-error" class="mb-2 block text-sm font-medium text-fg-danger">Con error</label>
        <input type="text" id="gallery-error" value="Valor inválido"
               class="block w-full rounded-lg border border-red-500 bg-red-50 p-2.5 text-sm text-red-900 focus:border-red-500 focus:ring-red-500 dark:border-red-500 dark:bg-gray-700 dark:text-red-400">
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-fg-danger">Este campo es obligatorio.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
        <input id="gallery-check" type="checkbox"
               class="h-4 w-4 rounded border-default bg-neutral-secondary-soft text-brand focus:ring-2 focus:ring-brand">
        <label for="gallery-check" class="text-sm text-body">Checkbox</label>
      </div>

      <label class="inline-flex cursor-pointer items-center gap-3">
        <input type="checkbox" class="peer sr-only">
        <span class="relative h-6 w-11 rounded-full bg-gray-200 after:absolute after:start-[2px] after:top-[2px] after:h-5 after:w-5 after:rounded-full after:border after:border-gray-300 after:bg-white after:transition-all after:content-[''] peer-checked:bg-brand peer-checked:after:translate-x-full peer-checked:after:border-white peer-focus:ring-4 peer-focus:ring-brand-soft dark:bg-gray-700"></span>
        <span class="text-sm text-body">Switch</span>
      </label>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="space-y-3">
    <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-heading">Card</h2>
    <div class="grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2">
      <div class="rounded-xl border border-default bg-neutral-primary p-5 shadow-sm">
        <div class="mb-3 flex items-start justify-between gap-3">
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-heading">Título de la card</h3>

          <button type="button" class="inline-flex h-8 w-8 items-center justify-center rounded-lg text-body hover:bg-neutral-tertiary hover:text-heading"
                  data-dropdown-toggle="gallery-card-menu" data-dropdown-placement="bottom-end" aria-label="Acciones">
            <%= icon(:settings) %>
          </button>

          <div id="gallery-card-menu" class="z-50 hidden w-40 rounded-lg bg-white shadow-lg dark:bg-gray-800">
            <ul class="py-1 text-sm text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-200">
              <li><a href="#" class="block px-4 py-2 hover:bg-gray-100 dark:hover:bg-gray-700 dark:hover:text-white">Editar</a></li>
              <li><a href="#" class="block px-4 py-2 hover:bg-gray-100 dark:hover:bg-gray-700 dark:hover:text-white">Eliminar</a></li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
        <p class="text-sm text-body">Contenido de ejemplo con texto secundario.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="rounded-xl border border-default bg-neutral-primary p-5 shadow-sm">
        <h3 class="mb-3 font-semibold text-heading">Badges</h3>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
          <span class="rounded-full bg-brand-soft px-2.5 py-0.5 text-xs font-medium text-fg-brand">Brand</span>
          <span class="rounded-full bg-green-100 px-2.5 py-0.5 text-xs font-medium text-green-800 dark:bg-green-900 dark:text-green-300">Al día</span>
          <span class="rounded-full bg-yellow-100 px-2.5 py-0.5 text-xs font-medium text-yellow-800 dark:bg-yellow-900 dark:text-yellow-300">Por vencer</span>
          <span class="rounded-full bg-red-100 px-2.5 py-0.5 text-xs font-medium text-red-800 dark:bg-red-900 dark:text-red-300">Vencido</span>
          <span class="rounded-full bg-gray-100 px-2.5 py-0.5 text-xs font-medium text-gray-800 dark:bg-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300">Neutro</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="space-y-3">
    <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-heading">Alertas</h2>
    <div class="space-y-2">
      <div class="rounded-lg border border-blue-300 bg-blue-50 p-4 text-sm text-blue-800 dark:border-blue-800 dark:bg-gray-800 dark:text-blue-400" role="alert">Mensaje informativo.</div>
      <div class="rounded-lg border border-green-300 bg-green-50 p-4 text-sm text-green-800 dark:border-green-800 dark:bg-gray-800 dark:text-green-400" role="alert">Operación exitosa.</div>
      <div class="rounded-lg border border-red-300 bg-red-50 p-4 text-sm text-red-800 dark:border-red-800 dark:bg-gray-800 dark:text-red-400" role="alert">Ocurrió un error.</div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="space-y-3">
    <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-heading">Tabla</h2>
    <div class="overflow-x-auto rounded-xl border border-default">
      <table class="w-full text-left text-sm">
        <thead class="bg-neutral-secondary-medium text-xs uppercase tracking-wide text-body-subtle">
          <tr>
            <th scope="col" class="px-4 py-3 font-semibold">Equipo</th>
            <th scope="col" class="px-4 py-3 font-semibold">Ubicación</th>
            <th scope="col" class="px-4 py-3 font-semibold">Estado</th>
            <th scope="col" class="px-4 py-3 text-right font-semibold">Acciones</th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody class="divide-y divide-default bg-neutral-primary">
          <% 3.times do |i| %>
            <tr class="hover:bg-neutral-secondary-soft">
              <td class="px-4 py-3 font-medium text-heading">UPS <%= i + 1 %></td>
              <td class="px-4 py-3 text-body">Sala de máquinas</td>
              <td class="px-4 py-3">
                <span class="rounded-full bg-green-100 px-2.5 py-0.5 text-xs font-medium text-green-800 dark:bg-green-900 dark:text-green-300">En servicio</span>
              </td>
              <td class="px-4 py-3">
                <div class="flex justify-end gap-1">
                  <button type="button" class="inline-flex h-8 w-8 items-center justify-center rounded-lg text-body hover:bg-neutral-tertiary hover:text-heading" aria-label="Editar"><%= icon(:edit) %></button>
                  <button type="button" class="inline-flex h-8 w-8 items-center justify-center rounded-lg text-body hover:bg-red-100 hover:text-red-700 dark:hover:bg-red-900/40" aria-label="Eliminar"><%= icon(:trash) %></button>
                </div>
              </td>
            </tr>
          <% end %>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>

    <%= render "shared/pagination", pagy: @pagy %>
  </section>

  <section class="space-y-3">
    <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-heading">Tabs</h2>
    <div class="border-b border-default">
      <ul class="-mb-px flex flex-wrap gap-1 text-sm font-medium" id="gallery-tabs" data-tabs-toggle="#gallery-tabs-content" role="tablist">
        <% [["Detalle", "detail", true], ["Servicios", "services", false], ["Informes", "reports", false]].each do |label, key, active| %>
          <li role="presentation">
            <button class="inline-block border-b-2 px-4 py-3" id="gallery-tab-<%= key %>"
                    data-tabs-target="#gallery-panel-<%= key %>" type="button" role="tab"
                    aria-controls="gallery-panel-<%= key %>" aria-selected="<%= active %>"><%= label %></button>
          </li>
        <% end %>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div id="gallery-tabs-content">
      <% [["detail", "Contenido del detalle."], ["services", "Listado de servicios."], ["reports", "Informes asociados."]].each_with_index do |(key, text), index| %>
        <div class="<%= "hidden" unless index.zero? %> p-4 text-sm text-body" id="gallery-panel-<%= key %>" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="gallery-tab-<%= key %>">
          <%= text %>
        </div>
      <% end %>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="space-y-3">
    <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-heading">Accordion</h2>
    <div id="gallery-accordion" data-accordion="collapse">
      <% [["one", "Primera sección", "Contenido de la primera sección."], ["two", "Segunda sección", "Contenido de la segunda sección."]].each_with_index do |(key, title, body), index| %>
        <h3 id="gallery-accordion-heading-<%= key %>">
          <button type="button"
                  class="flex w-full items-center justify-between gap-3 border border-default <%= index.zero? ? "rounded-t-lg" : "border-t-0" %> p-4 text-left text-sm font-medium text-heading hover:bg-neutral-tertiary"
                  data-accordion-target="#gallery-accordion-body-<%= key %>"
                  aria-expanded="<%= index.zero? %>"
                  aria-controls="gallery-accordion-body-<%= key %>">
            <span><%= title %></span>
            <svg class="h-3 w-3 shrink-0 rotate-180" aria-hidden="true" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 10 6">
              <path stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 5 5 1 1 5" />
            </svg>
          </button>
        </h3>
        <div id="gallery-accordion-body-<%= key %>" class="<%= "hidden" unless index.zero? %>" aria-labelledby="gallery-accordion-heading-<%= key %>">
          <div class="border border-t-0 border-default p-4 text-sm text-body"><%= body %></div>
        </div>
      <% end %>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="space-y-3">
    <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-heading">Modal</h2>
    <button type="button"
            class="rounded-lg bg-brand px-5 py-2.5 text-sm font-medium text-white hover:bg-brand-strong"
            data-modal-target="gallery-modal" data-modal-toggle="gallery-modal">
      Abrir modal
    </button>

    <div id="gallery-modal" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true"
         class="fixed inset-0 z-50 hidden h-full w-full items-center justify-center p-4">
      <div class="relative max-h-full w-full max-w-lg rounded-xl bg-neutral-primary shadow-xl">
        <div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-4 border-b border-default px-5 py-4">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-heading">Título del modal</h3>
          <button type="button" class="inline-flex h-9 w-9 items-center justify-center rounded-lg text-body hover:bg-neutral-tertiary hover:text-heading" data-modal-hide="gallery-modal" aria-label="Cerrar">
            <svg class="h-3.5 w-3.5" aria-hidden="true" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 14 14">
              <path stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="m1 1 6 6m0 0 6 6M7 7l6-6M7 7l-6 6" />
            </svg>
          </button>
        </div>
        <div class="px-5 py-4 text-sm text-body">
          Este modal usa el auto-init declarativo de Flowbite. El modal remoto del layout, en cambio, se maneja
          desde <code class="rounded bg-neutral-tertiary px-1">modal</code> porque su contenido llega por turbo stream.
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="space-y-3">
    <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-heading">Tooltip</h2>
    <span class="cursor-help underline decoration-dotted text-body"
          data-controller="tooltip"
          data-tooltip-text-value="Este texto lo renderiza el controller tooltip.">
      Pasá el mouse por acá
    </span>
  </section>
</div>
